---
import DemoLayout from '@/layouts/DemoLayout.astro';
import Header from './_components/Header.astro';
import Footer from './_components/Footer.astro';
import {enquiry} from '@/content/demos/aangan-form/projects';
import './_components/theme.css';
export const prerender = true;
---
<DemoLayout demoSlug="aangan-form" title="Plan a space — Sample budget calculator | Aangan / Form" description="Explore fictional interior execution and design fee ranges by area and finish level, with clear assumptions and exclusions." fontsHref="/fonts/demos/aangan-form/fonts.css" themeColor="#eeece5"><div class="aangan"><Header active="plan"/><main class="af-wrap"><div class="af-page-head"><p class="af-mono">Before the first sketch</p><h1>Give the idea<br/>some dimensions.</h1><p>A starting conversation in square feet and rupees. Adjust the inputs to understand how area and material choices change a fictional residential interior budget.</p></div><section class="af-planner" data-af-planner><div class="af-controls"><label for="af-area">Carpet area · square feet<input id="af-area" data-af-area type="number" min="300" max="10000" step="50" value="1200"/><span class="af-note">Enter 300–10,000 sq ft in steps of 50.</span></label><label>Finish direction<select data-af-finish><option value="essential">Essential — restrained finishes</option><option value="considered" selected>Considered — custom joinery & detail</option><option value="crafted">Crafted — richer material palette</option></select></label><p class="af-note">Illustrative execution rates per sq ft: Essential ₹1,600–₹2,200; Considered ₹2,300–₹3,200; Crafted ₹3,300–₹4,600. Design fee: ₹150–₹250 per sq ft, shown separately.</p><p class="af-note">These are fictional modelling assumptions, not researched market rates or a quotation. Estimates exclude taxes, loose furniture, appliances, structural work and approvals.</p></div><div class="af-estimate"><p class="af-mono">Your sample range</p><div role="status" aria-live="polite"><p>Interior execution</p><output data-af-execution>₹27.6–38.4 lakh</output><p>Design fees, separately</p><output data-af-fees>₹1.8–3.0 lakh</output><p data-af-assumption>1,200 sq ft · Considered finish</p></div><p>No budget is submitted or appointment booked. A real quote needs a measured site survey and an agreed scope.</p><a href={enquiry} class="af-link" data-analytics-event="cta_click" data-demo-slug="aangan-form">Enquire about a studio website ↗</a><noscript><p>JavaScript is needed to recalculate. The initial example uses 1,200 sq ft and the Considered finish.</p></noscript></div></section><section class="af-scope af-section" style="border-top:1px solid #282b2744"><div><h2>Bring to the<br/>conversation.</h2><ul><li>A floor plan, even if it is an old one</li><li>A room-by-room list of what works and what does not</li><li>Your intended timeline and total budget</li><li>A few references, with what you like about each</li></ul></div><div><h2>Keep room for<br/>the unknowns.</h2><p style="margin-top:25px">Existing electrical work, concealed plumbing and site access can change the scope. A sample estimate helps frame questions; a real survey and itemised quotation answer them.</p></div></section></main><Footer/></div><script src="../../../scripts/demos/aangan-form-planner.ts"/></DemoLayout>
